      "id": 1,
      "text": "Pigtown earned its nickname in the late 1800s when pigs hauled by the B&O Railroad were herded across streets for slaughter.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        12,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
